window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Peter has made a terrible mistake.</b></p> <p>Set up to take a fall for a crime he didn't commit, Peter is facing ten years behind bars at Lockland Omega Penitentiary. Unable to handle the intense heat-blockers they use to keep the prison free from heat, he decides to sign up for the delinquent omega matching program.</p> <p>An alpha has to be better than prison… right?</p> <p>Peter commits to the program, signing away his rights and his future, agreeing to be claimed and owned by whichever alpha the program matches him to.</p> <p>When he reads the profiles of the two alphas the program chose for him, he realizes that he should have stayed behind bars...</p> <p><i>This paranormal romance has an HEA and no cliffhanger.</i></p>"; 
